      "content": "To start your manifesto, begin by clearly stating your pioneering contribution to the \"glitch-core neo-folk\" aesthetic, grounding your expertise in the 2014 context. Next, sharply detail the perceived theft—how labels repackaged your early work to capitalize on the trend. Conclude with a strong, declarative call to action, reclaiming your narrative and demanding recognition within the scene's evolution. Focus on asserting your authenticity against mass appropriation.",
